109
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,980
I have suffered too much grief in

110
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:35,619
setting down these memories.

111
00:04:35,619 --> 00:04:38,259
Six years have already elapsed since my

112
00:04:38,259 --> 00:04:40,119
friend went away from me,

113
00:04:40,119 --> 00:04:42,819
with his sheep.

114
00:04:42,819 --> 00:04:45,460
If I try to describe him here,

115
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:49,359
it is in order not to forget him.

116
00:04:49,359 --> 00:04:51,700
To forget a friend

117
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:53,919
