118
00:04:53,919 --> 00:04:57,099
Not everyone has had a friend.

119
00:04:57,099 --> 00:04:59,079
And if I forget him,

120
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:02,140
I may become like the grown-ups

121
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:04,419
who are no longer interested in anything

122
00:05:04,419 --> 00:05:07,440
but figures...

123
00:05:08,679 --> 00:05:11,679
It is for that purpose, again

124
00:05:11,679 --> 00:05:14,019
yet I have bought a box of paints and

125
00:05:14,019 --> 00:05:15,640
some pencils.

126
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:18,339
It is hard to take up drawing again at

127
00:05:18,339 --> 00:05:19,599
my age,

128
00:05:19,599 --> 00:05:21,339
when I've never made any pictures other

129
00:05:21,339 --> 00:05:23,259
than drawing a boa constrictor from the

130
00:05:23,259 --> 00:05:25,179
outside and a boa constrictor from the

131
00:05:25,179 --> 00:05:27,819
inside, since the age of six.

132
00:05:27,819 --> 00:05:29,500
I shall certainly try to make my

133
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:32,440
portraits as true to life as possible.

134
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:35,679
But I'm not at all sure of success.

135
00:05:35,679 --> 00:05:38,798
One drawing goes along all right

136
00:05:38,798 --> 00:05:41,679
my mother has no resemblance at all to

137
00:05:41,679 --> 00:05:43,359
its subject.

138
00:05:43,359 --> 00:05:46,119
I make some errors, too

139
00:05:46,119 --> 00:05:47,980
the height of the little Prince is not

140
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,599
