145
00:05:59,798 --> 00:06:03,160
So I fumble along as best as I can,

146
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,859
now good how bad,

147
00:06:05,859 --> 00:06:10,740
and I hope generally fair to middling

148
00:06:11,558 --> 00:06:14,019
In certain more important details I

149
00:06:14,019 --> 00:06:17,259
