150
00:06:17,259 --> 00:06:18,940
But that is something that will not be

151
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:21,700
my fault and I must be forgiven for that

152
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:24,400
My friend never explained anything to me.

153
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,900
He thought, perhaps, that I was like

154
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:28,319
